WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.480
EPISODE 21

02:03.560 --> 02:05.520
Didn't I tell you
not to let anyone disturb me?

02:13.120 --> 02:14.080
Master,

02:14.160 --> 02:16.320
the old lady heard you were working late

02:16.400 --> 02:18.920
and asked your wife
to bring this chicken soup.

02:50.240 --> 02:51.680
He already had dinner.

02:51.760 --> 02:53.280
Don't waste Granny's care.

02:53.360 --> 02:54.760
Perfect. I'm feeling hungry.

02:54.840 --> 02:55.960
I'll drink it.

03:30.800 --> 03:32.160
You can't drink this.

03:39.920 --> 03:40.760
What's in it?

03:42.440 --> 03:45.360
Just beetles, snake bed seeds,

03:45.440 --> 03:47.400
silkworm moths, and bull…

03:48.320 --> 03:49.440
pizzle.

03:55.400 --> 03:56.680
How do you know that?

03:56.760 --> 03:58.760
My family sells fragrant medicine,

03:58.840 --> 04:00.280
makes incense pills and cakes.

04:01.200 --> 04:03.360
I'm often around the pharmacy,

04:03.960 --> 04:05.520
so I recognized the smell.

04:06.320 --> 04:08.560
Don't you want to stay here?

04:09.240 --> 04:10.080
Why stop this?

04:10.920 --> 04:13.920
I… Oh, your robe is untidy.

04:14.000 --> 04:15.320
Let me fix it.

04:24.560 --> 04:25.720
Open the door.

04:25.800 --> 04:28.200
It's the old lady's order.
Please understand.

04:28.880 --> 04:30.800
Yurui, this isn't right.

04:30.880 --> 04:32.320
How can you lock the master in?

04:32.400 --> 04:33.360
Outside the Shen house,

04:33.440 --> 04:35.200
the master holds authority and respect,

04:35.280 --> 04:36.600
but here, at home,

04:36.680 --> 04:38.600
the old lady's word is absolute.

04:38.680 --> 04:39.840
Stay here and behave.

04:41.680 --> 04:42.720
Nonsense.

04:43.800 --> 04:45.440
Granny meant well,

04:46.240 --> 04:49.440
but if I just go along,
it feels like taking advantage.

04:50.160 --> 04:53.080
I may be from a humble family,
but I have my pride.

04:54.200 --> 04:55.560
I won't stoop to such tricks.

05:06.880 --> 05:09.600
You sleep on the bed tonight.
I'll manage on the chair.

05:53.960 --> 05:57.200
- Li Haode?
- I barely drank any of it.

05:57.880 --> 06:00.960
Now I feel feverish.

06:01.040 --> 06:01.960
Maybe I'm sick.

06:03.840 --> 06:05.320
Don't believe me?

06:06.160 --> 06:08.960
If you don't, then touch my forehead.

06:10.880 --> 06:12.960
There's a cure, but get up first.

06:27.320 --> 06:30.120
No, tell them to open the door now.

06:30.200 --> 06:31.760
It's so stuffy in here. I need air.

06:32.360 --> 06:35.520
Granny ordered no one

06:35.600 --> 06:36.720
to open it until dawn.

06:37.480 --> 06:40.320
Didn't you say there's a cure?
Where is it?

06:40.400 --> 06:41.640
SCRIPTURE

06:42.840 --> 06:44.440
Write these out tonight

06:44.520 --> 06:47.320
and you'll be fine. Stay calm.

06:47.400 --> 06:49.360
- You!
- Seem affected by the drug.

06:49.440 --> 06:50.520
You won't sleep tonight.

06:51.120 --> 06:53.960
Just take this chance to keep writing.

06:54.040 --> 06:55.040
I'm off to bed.

07:33.480 --> 07:34.880
It should go here.

07:43.120 --> 07:44.720
Why do you smell of wine?

07:46.800 --> 07:48.840
If I hadn't stepped in for your mom,

07:48.920 --> 07:51.760
those guild folks would've kept pestering.

07:52.360 --> 07:54.520
Even over tea prices, they made a fuss.

07:55.440 --> 07:57.080
I meddled

07:57.680 --> 07:59.280
but delayed coming home.

08:01.880 --> 08:03.040
Who told you to play smart?

08:04.400 --> 08:05.760
I want it to go here.

08:05.840 --> 08:07.720
If I weren't smarter than you,

08:07.800 --> 08:09.840
how could I bring you into my home?

08:09.920 --> 08:12.480
You tricked me,

08:12.560 --> 08:14.600
begged me over and over.

08:14.680 --> 08:18.400
If I hadn't guessed
your mom's and your ways,

08:18.480 --> 08:21.000
how would I dare lure you into my trap?

08:22.880 --> 08:26.120
So, when you said you'd sail away,

08:27.640 --> 08:28.800
was that also to test me?

08:32.440 --> 08:34.800
- Chai An?
- Kangning.

08:34.880 --> 08:36.520
- So, that's it.
- Kangning.

08:36.600 --> 08:38.640
Kangning, Kangning.

08:38.720 --> 08:41.600
My dear Kangning.

08:42.160 --> 08:43.880
My--

08:44.760 --> 08:46.680
Honey, listen to me.

08:49.520 --> 08:50.640
What are you laughing at?

08:53.040 --> 08:56.560
Honey, I'll get back to work.
I'll bring you a gift when I'm back.

09:00.520 --> 09:01.880
I'm off now.

09:03.720 --> 09:06.120
- Why not take a sedan chair?
- No need for that.

09:06.200 --> 09:07.800
I'll walk off the alcohol.

09:08.320 --> 09:09.800
So she won't hold it against me.

09:14.640 --> 09:17.000
Where's the Mahāra I brought from Pan?

09:17.080 --> 09:18.240
The one

09:19.960 --> 09:22.440
with the red vest and small hat.

09:22.520 --> 09:25.320
Kangning glanced at it twice
on the street yesterday.

09:26.040 --> 09:29.760
You've bought her so many things already.
Maybe it got misplaced somewhere.

09:29.840 --> 09:31.360
Can we just get another one?

09:32.080 --> 09:34.200
Check Pan Restaurant.
It's probably still there.

09:34.800 --> 09:36.360
Hurry, go now.

09:37.200 --> 09:39.280
Wait here, sir. I'll be right back.

09:39.360 --> 09:40.240
Hurry.

09:54.480 --> 09:55.520
Murder!

09:55.600 --> 09:57.480
He wants to kill me!

09:58.080 --> 09:59.880
Please help me! Help!

09:59.960 --> 10:01.600
He's the killer!

10:01.680 --> 10:03.400
Save me!

10:03.480 --> 10:04.880
He wants to kill me!

11:00.600 --> 11:02.200
Alright, stop crying.

11:04.440 --> 11:07.760
If not for your family's grand escort,

11:07.840 --> 11:09.160
who'd bear this humiliation?

11:09.960 --> 11:13.200
Granny didn't just bring soup.
She locked the door.

11:13.280 --> 11:15.920
If I hadn't borrowed your couch,

11:16.000 --> 11:17.440
I'd have frozen to death.

11:18.160 --> 11:20.080
What kind of official are you?

11:20.160 --> 11:22.000
What cases do you even handle?

11:22.080 --> 11:26.320
Forcing me
to copy scriptures all night unfairly.

11:26.400 --> 11:29.000
You'll crush people with injustice.

11:30.080 --> 11:31.480
Li Haode,

11:32.000 --> 11:34.040
ambition is admirable,

11:34.120 --> 11:35.880
but it's wise to retreat from dead ends.

11:36.560 --> 11:39.200
You've tried enough. It's time to let go.

11:39.280 --> 11:43.000
For one year, we'll remain as a couple.

11:43.080 --> 11:44.520
In private, we're like siblings.

11:45.640 --> 11:46.880
When the year ends,

11:46.960 --> 11:49.000
I'll find you a well-matched husband.

11:49.080 --> 11:51.240
You'll be my adopted sister.

11:51.320 --> 11:53.960
You'll marry with honor, alright?

11:55.960 --> 11:59.280
- My lord.
- Call me brother. All cousins do.

11:59.880 --> 12:02.000
- But brother--
- What?

12:02.600 --> 12:04.600
- You still have hope?
- No.

12:05.200 --> 12:07.360
- The old lady--
- That's my worry.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.400
You don't need to fret about it.

12:14.840 --> 12:16.920
The door's open.

12:17.760 --> 12:18.920
Go back.

12:22.320 --> 12:23.200
Come in.

12:27.760 --> 12:30.080
Master, there was a murder last night.

12:50.480 --> 12:51.920
Haode,

12:52.000 --> 12:54.920
I dressed like this for you.

12:55.000 --> 12:57.000
You agreed too quickly. Is this fair?

12:59.120 --> 13:01.640
We made a bet, remember? Either…

13:03.440 --> 13:04.880
treat me as your elder sister.

13:06.600 --> 13:08.280
Dream on.

13:08.360 --> 13:10.920
That day won't come, little sister.

13:15.000 --> 13:16.720
My lady, your family gives you a message.

13:16.800 --> 13:18.920
They said
Master Chai was accused of murder.

13:19.000 --> 13:21.440
- He's in jail now.
- Murder?

13:23.120 --> 13:24.040
This is bad.

13:24.120 --> 13:26.480
Shouhua's away visiting family with Du.

13:26.560 --> 13:28.160
They're not in the capital.

13:28.240 --> 13:29.800
What do we do now?

13:34.760 --> 13:37.280
KAIFENG COURT

13:39.920 --> 13:43.240
My lady, when my lord hears cases,
he never meets guests.

13:43.320 --> 13:44.440
Not even family.

13:47.280 --> 13:49.040
Tell him I'll wait in the side hall.

13:49.120 --> 13:50.960
He'll finish eventually, right?

13:58.640 --> 13:59.680
Shen Huizhao!

14:00.920 --> 14:03.160
How can you punish blindly?

14:03.240 --> 14:05.000
What kind of judge are you?

14:05.080 --> 14:06.120
Chai.

14:13.240 --> 14:15.280
Officials handling cases

14:15.360 --> 14:18.960
can't be close relatives or in-laws.

14:19.040 --> 14:20.120
This is the regulation.

14:20.200 --> 14:22.640
This case should go to a higher court.

14:22.720 --> 14:25.440
A fair decision will come.

14:26.040 --> 14:28.840
I took this case and will be just.

14:28.920 --> 14:29.920
I won't show favoritism.

14:30.000 --> 14:32.280
You claim innocence in court,

14:32.360 --> 14:33.560
but have no witnesses.

14:33.640 --> 14:35.520
Twenty more lashes are due.

14:37.040 --> 14:38.800
Only a few questions in,

14:38.880 --> 14:40.160
and already the rod?

14:42.120 --> 14:44.200
Shen Huizhao, you're a fool.

14:52.240 --> 14:55.240
Hold the suspect for now.
We'll try the case later.

14:59.360 --> 15:01.880
You shouldn't be here. Go home.

15:02.440 --> 15:05.600
I've been to court. Why not the side hall?

15:05.680 --> 15:07.720
How do you punish without inquiry?

15:08.360 --> 15:09.480
We are related!

15:09.560 --> 15:12.480
I'm not asking for leniency,
just no extra punishment.

15:13.160 --> 15:15.840
Because of the Shen-Chai ties,

15:15.920 --> 15:17.040
should it be worse?

15:17.120 --> 15:18.440
Anyone linked to my family,

15:18.520 --> 15:20.400
if guilty, gets harsher punishment

15:20.480 --> 15:23.240
if I'm the judge.

15:23.320 --> 15:24.400
Qingshi.

15:24.480 --> 15:26.080
- Master.
- Ready a carriage for her.

15:26.160 --> 15:27.080
Sure.

15:27.160 --> 15:28.200
Brother!

15:31.080 --> 15:33.800
Haode, we have no leads yet.

15:33.880 --> 15:35.000
What do we do?

15:35.080 --> 15:36.160
Leshan, listen to me.

15:36.240 --> 15:38.760
Mom and Kangning
will be worried sick at home.

15:38.840 --> 15:41.280
Go home and tell them
I'll figure something out.

15:41.360 --> 15:42.240
Alright.

15:51.320 --> 15:52.400
No need to say more.

15:52.480 --> 15:54.320
That Madam Liu, she's the wife of Liu.

15:54.400 --> 15:56.400
She said Chai was drunk and raped her.

15:56.960 --> 15:59.000
Later, her husband caught them
and was killed by Chai.

15:59.080 --> 16:00.840
Chai An has a big name.

16:00.920 --> 16:02.760
He'd never do that.

16:02.840 --> 16:05.600
Besides, Deqing only left briefly.

16:05.680 --> 16:07.160
How could he commit such acts?

16:07.240 --> 16:08.480
This isn't your concern.

16:09.480 --> 16:12.120
No matter what, stay away from the court.

16:13.640 --> 16:17.160
I can't ignore my brother-in-law's plight.

16:17.760 --> 16:19.440
If you don't explain, I'll go tomorrow.

16:23.480 --> 16:26.720
Days ago, I sentenced 12 criminals.

16:26.800 --> 16:28.800
They were ruthless bandits.

16:28.880 --> 16:31.440
Some escaped capture
due to poor enforcement.

16:31.520 --> 16:33.760
When going out,
you should inform the old lady.

16:33.840 --> 16:35.240
Take more people with you.

16:35.320 --> 16:37.440
Stop rushing out alone.

16:38.480 --> 16:40.000
But isn't it dangerous for you?

16:45.040 --> 16:46.520
You can change your mind.

16:47.040 --> 16:49.680
Take the divorce papers.
I'll keep my promise.

16:51.280 --> 16:52.280
Never.

17:03.400 --> 17:04.800
Why are you getting in my way?

17:05.360 --> 17:06.440
Stay calm.

17:08.480 --> 17:09.840
Step aside.

17:09.920 --> 17:11.160
The horse is spooked!

17:18.240 --> 17:19.160
Get out of the way!

17:24.200 --> 17:25.280
Watch out!

17:34.680 --> 17:36.280
Qingshi, what's going on?

17:36.360 --> 17:38.880
Be careful!
The carriage is out of control!

17:40.520 --> 17:41.720
Move!

17:48.440 --> 17:49.720
Watch out! Hurry, move!

18:04.640 --> 18:07.200
Master!

18:08.760 --> 18:09.880
- Is anyone inside?
- Master!

18:09.960 --> 18:10.840
Brother.

18:11.520 --> 18:13.440
- Check on them.
- Brother.

18:14.120 --> 18:15.200
Brother!

18:16.400 --> 18:18.480
Don't scare me.

18:18.560 --> 18:21.160
Brother!

18:26.000 --> 18:27.520
Sir,

18:27.600 --> 18:31.120
how's my grandson's condition?

18:31.840 --> 18:33.240
When will he wake up?

18:34.360 --> 18:35.320
Lady,

18:35.880 --> 18:38.120
forgive my bluntness.

18:38.200 --> 18:41.160
Head injuries

18:41.240 --> 18:43.280
aren't cured with medicine.

18:44.080 --> 18:47.040
In this case, even a miracle worker

18:47.120 --> 18:48.880
wouldn't dare give a prognosis.

18:48.960 --> 18:51.280
Let's wait for him to wake.

18:51.360 --> 18:53.680
Please, do your best.

18:53.760 --> 18:57.000
If he recovers,

18:57.080 --> 19:01.000
I'll reward you greatly.

19:06.720 --> 19:08.400
- Yingying!
- Yingying!

19:08.480 --> 19:09.560
- Yingying!
- Stop right there!

19:09.640 --> 19:12.080
Stop! Step back! Let me go!

19:12.800 --> 19:14.120
Yingying, don't be scared.

19:14.680 --> 19:17.320
Son, save Yingying!

19:17.400 --> 19:19.200
Tell them to back off!

19:20.040 --> 19:20.920
Son.

19:21.520 --> 19:22.600
SHEN YINGYING

19:22.680 --> 19:23.560
Dad!

19:24.280 --> 19:26.800
Let her go. I'll agree to anything!

19:27.400 --> 19:28.880
I'll make him release you now.

19:28.960 --> 19:31.320
Son, are you listening?

19:32.000 --> 19:34.160
- Yingying's scared.
- Let her go!

19:35.200 --> 19:37.000
- I'll trade for her.
- Stop!

19:37.720 --> 19:38.800
Who'd believe your lies?

19:39.520 --> 19:41.320
Tell them all to back off! Let me go.

19:42.960 --> 19:43.800
Back off!

19:44.520 --> 19:45.520
Son.

19:46.560 --> 19:49.000
You killed 12 people in Fengqiu County.

19:49.680 --> 19:52.000
If I let you escape today,

19:52.080 --> 19:53.920
how many more will die?

19:54.840 --> 19:57.800
Anyone who retreats is an accomplice!

19:57.880 --> 19:59.200
Son!

19:59.280 --> 20:01.280
Fine, then we all die together!

20:02.800 --> 20:04.880
- Yingying!
- Yingying!

20:11.040 --> 20:13.960
Son, your mother's grief

20:14.040 --> 20:15.720
has caused her to fall ill.

20:15.800 --> 20:19.120
Focus on work, not sorrow.

20:20.080 --> 20:22.200
You don't deserve family.

20:22.280 --> 20:24.520
I'll pretend you're not my son.

20:29.240 --> 20:30.200
Sir!

20:33.200 --> 20:34.080
Oh my God!

20:34.160 --> 20:36.200
- Old lady!
- Lady!

20:58.320 --> 21:00.640
He has been unconscious for a full day.

21:00.720 --> 21:02.280
To avoid keeping Granny's waiting,

21:02.360 --> 21:04.640
please inform her.

21:04.720 --> 21:07.000
I'll let her know once he wakes.

21:07.080 --> 21:08.760
Tell her to rest easy.

21:08.840 --> 21:10.840
Don't worry, my lady. Sure.

21:21.960 --> 21:24.440
Mom knows. Kangning is on it.

21:24.520 --> 21:25.440
He won't suffer much.

21:37.120 --> 21:39.080
Brother.

21:40.560 --> 21:41.680
You're awake!

21:50.800 --> 21:52.760
How do you feel?

22:00.160 --> 22:01.280
How do you feel?

22:07.760 --> 22:08.840
Hao…

22:10.400 --> 22:11.880
My lady.

22:11.960 --> 22:14.480
Why does he seem… off?

22:17.440 --> 22:18.560
Who…

22:19.640 --> 22:20.840
Who are you?

22:34.080 --> 22:37.520
My lady, is he…

22:40.440 --> 22:42.400
Is he…?

22:46.760 --> 22:50.040
Master.

22:50.120 --> 22:52.040
This is your wife.

22:52.720 --> 22:56.040
How could you forget her?

22:59.240 --> 23:00.400
Honey.

23:04.520 --> 23:05.440
I…

23:07.520 --> 23:08.480
I don't know you.

23:10.360 --> 23:12.520
Why would I lie to you?

23:12.600 --> 23:16.320
You're so sick, you've forgotten me.

23:16.400 --> 23:17.840
The physician's staying nearby.

23:17.920 --> 23:19.920
I'll fetch him immediately.

23:20.000 --> 23:22.840
Don't move around. You'll make it worse.

23:23.440 --> 23:25.880
Leshan, let's go.

23:43.880 --> 23:46.440
Oh no, Shen has turned into a fool.

23:47.120 --> 23:49.560
Can the old lady handle this?
Will they let you off?

23:51.400 --> 23:52.560
This isn't a big deal.

23:52.640 --> 23:55.360
But Chai's case will be tried
by other judges.

23:55.960 --> 23:57.320
Or get transferred.

23:57.400 --> 23:58.800
Then, we'll have no way then.

23:59.480 --> 24:02.280
But misfortune can bring opportunity.

24:02.360 --> 24:04.240
For you, it's good news.

24:05.520 --> 24:06.400
Good news?

24:07.160 --> 24:09.680
If you can win him over,

24:09.760 --> 24:11.880
you'll be a true Lady of the Shen family.

24:12.720 --> 24:14.560
Don't miss this chance.

24:14.640 --> 24:16.080
Do whatever it takes.

24:16.160 --> 24:17.520
Don't slip up.

24:20.880 --> 24:22.200
Du said before

24:22.280 --> 24:24.000
the magistrate's position is tough.

24:24.760 --> 24:26.720
He hasn't been officially appointed yet.

24:26.800 --> 24:28.400
He's just acting as a stand-in.

24:28.480 --> 24:30.240
His position isn't secure.

24:30.840 --> 24:31.680
So what?

24:34.320 --> 24:35.720
The people of Bianjing

24:35.800 --> 24:38.520
want a fair and strict magistrate.

24:38.600 --> 24:41.120
If he loses that seat because of me,

24:41.200 --> 24:42.560
then I'd be to blame for it all.

24:46.960 --> 24:47.840
That can't happen.

25:03.080 --> 25:04.160
Yes, we're married,

25:04.240 --> 25:05.520
but no temple visit.

25:05.600 --> 25:06.920
You didn't want to marry me.

25:07.000 --> 25:09.040
You saw me as a sister.
So, I called you brother.

25:09.120 --> 25:09.960
Do you remember now?

25:17.080 --> 25:20.400
You're overseeing Kaifeng
as acting governor.

25:20.480 --> 25:23.480
You're an incorruptible and just official.

25:24.840 --> 25:27.000
You're the third son of the Shen family.

25:27.080 --> 25:29.800
With no brothers to help, you bear it all.

25:30.560 --> 25:33.040
This attack injured your head severely.

25:33.120 --> 25:35.960
Your servant Qingshi's leg was hurt too.

25:36.040 --> 25:39.160
At least the bandits have been caught.

25:39.680 --> 25:41.200
My silly sister.

25:41.280 --> 25:43.280
Leshan, quick, get the physician.

25:44.400 --> 25:45.520
Sure.

25:49.880 --> 25:51.000
It's okay.

25:51.080 --> 25:53.480
That's my real sister.

25:53.560 --> 25:55.640
She disguised herself to stay by my side,

25:55.720 --> 25:57.360
afraid I'd be mistreated by the Shens.

25:59.280 --> 26:01.120
Brother, ask me anything.

26:01.200 --> 26:03.280
I'll tell you everything I know.

26:04.320 --> 26:06.200
But about your illness…

26:06.280 --> 26:07.800
Granny's health isn't great.

26:07.880 --> 26:09.800
Whether to tell the truth or not

26:09.880 --> 26:11.080
depends on you.

26:16.480 --> 26:18.400
My grandson.

26:18.480 --> 26:22.440
Always making enemies with outlaws.

26:22.520 --> 26:24.800
How can you ever have peace?

26:25.920 --> 26:28.360
Better resign and quit being an official.

26:28.440 --> 26:30.960
At least you won't come back

26:32.040 --> 26:34.120
injured again.

26:34.200 --> 26:37.040
How would I handle it next time?

26:37.120 --> 26:39.600
I'd rather close my eyes for good.

26:39.680 --> 26:43.280
Better than living in constant fear.

26:43.960 --> 26:47.640
Granny, forgive me for worrying you.

26:47.720 --> 26:48.680
I'm fine now, truly.

26:49.960 --> 26:50.840
See?

26:52.320 --> 26:54.760
Blessed people are always protected.

26:54.840 --> 26:57.160
Just stay careful when you're out.

26:57.240 --> 26:58.800
Don't let scoundrels take advantage.

27:06.920 --> 27:09.680
Look at him acting innocent.

27:09.760 --> 27:10.960
He's better than me.

27:18.680 --> 27:21.560
- Tell me about the case.
- Okay.

27:21.640 --> 27:22.840
Three nights ago,

27:22.920 --> 27:25.440
my brother-in-law was passing
Tianshui Alley.

27:25.520 --> 27:26.560
He was falsely accused.

27:29.520 --> 27:30.560
Like this.

27:41.120 --> 27:41.960
Remember?

27:42.040 --> 27:43.880
Zhang Ping's wife, Liu,

27:43.960 --> 27:45.760
accused him of drunken assault.

27:45.840 --> 27:48.200
She said Zhang caught him, they fought,

27:48.280 --> 27:49.800
and Zhang fell out and died.

27:51.280 --> 27:54.400
But here's the strange part.
Only two people were there.

27:54.920 --> 27:57.440
Why not question Zhang's wife?

27:57.520 --> 27:59.320
Why only beat your brother-in-law?

27:59.400 --> 28:02.400
You told them to beat him. I don't know.

28:02.480 --> 28:04.960
- You know why.
- Me?

28:05.040 --> 28:07.560
What? You really don't remember?

28:11.160 --> 28:12.880
In this situation,

28:12.960 --> 28:15.120
how can we hide this from Granny and Dad

28:15.200 --> 28:17.520
and let you preside over this case?

28:25.040 --> 28:26.280
Let me think more on it.

28:27.080 --> 28:30.040
I heard Shen got hurt. Is it serious?

28:30.120 --> 28:33.280
What about Chai's case?

28:33.360 --> 28:35.440
Tell me. What is he going to do about it?

28:35.520 --> 28:37.880
Mom, just minor injuries. He's fine.

28:37.960 --> 28:39.920
As for the case, he'll handle it.

28:40.000 --> 28:40.840
No need to worry.

28:40.920 --> 28:42.320
- I--
- Haode.

28:42.400 --> 28:43.480
- You're here.
- Kangning.

28:43.560 --> 28:44.400
Kangning.

28:44.480 --> 28:46.160
Does Chai have a royal pardon document?

28:46.240 --> 28:47.800
Ca-can it save a life?

28:47.880 --> 28:49.520
Mom, he didn't kill anyone.

28:49.600 --> 28:50.880
No need to worry, okay?

28:50.960 --> 28:52.480
- Don't worry, Mom.
- I don't.

28:52.560 --> 28:54.400
How is this?

28:57.360 --> 28:59.120
What happened exactly?

29:00.880 --> 29:02.200
Chai told me

29:02.280 --> 29:05.240
Shen didn't even ask any questions first
but hit him directly.

29:05.320 --> 29:07.360
He's afraid of being accused
of favoritism.

29:07.440 --> 29:10.680
He's not like the old strict Judge Shen.

29:11.760 --> 29:13.200
Your brother-in-law found it odd,

29:13.280 --> 29:15.520
so he went along and took the punishment.

29:16.240 --> 29:18.440
He wants you to find him

29:18.520 --> 29:20.040
and ask him what's really going on.

29:20.640 --> 29:22.040
He does have calculation,

29:22.120 --> 29:25.040
but he doesn't remember anything.
What should I say?

29:26.600 --> 29:29.640
Kangning, I admire you so much.

29:29.720 --> 29:32.000
Even in such chaos, you stay calm.

29:32.080 --> 29:34.080
If he's not panicking, I shouldn't either.

29:34.880 --> 29:37.160
Haode, let's sort this out together.

29:37.240 --> 29:39.120
Come, sit. We'll figure this out.

29:42.480 --> 29:43.680
KAIFENG COURT

29:43.760 --> 29:45.120
Summon the plaintiff, Liu,

29:45.200 --> 29:46.360
and the defendant, Chai An.

29:57.000 --> 29:58.520
How could Chai An

29:59.200 --> 30:01.160
carry a grappling hook home?

30:01.240 --> 30:03.880
It was late night. All doors were shut.

30:03.960 --> 30:05.840
Why was your window wide open?

30:05.920 --> 30:08.280
Did you let him climb in through the wall?

30:08.360 --> 30:09.880
My lord.

30:09.960 --> 30:12.560
I don't know why he had a grappling hook.

30:12.640 --> 30:14.440
I was ill

30:14.520 --> 30:16.160
and opened the window for air.

30:16.680 --> 30:17.920
He got mad and knocked me out

30:18.000 --> 30:20.160
when I caught him sneaking in.

30:20.760 --> 30:22.440
When I woke up, my husband was dead.

30:22.520 --> 30:25.360
No one else was there.
Who else could it be?

30:26.040 --> 30:29.360
I'm just a widow seeking justice
despite shame.

30:29.440 --> 30:34.080
It's clear he killed my husband.

30:34.160 --> 30:35.800
Yet you question me

30:35.880 --> 30:37.280
instead of punishing him?

30:37.880 --> 30:39.120
Are you favoring him?

30:40.400 --> 30:42.680
We've never met.

30:42.760 --> 30:44.840
Why lie to harm me?

30:44.920 --> 30:47.040
Even to death?

30:48.120 --> 30:49.120
My lord.

30:49.880 --> 30:52.000
I passed by the Zhang house,

30:52.080 --> 30:53.760
and he was dead.

30:54.600 --> 30:56.920
How do we know
she and her lover didn't do it?

30:57.000 --> 30:58.800
Who'd dare fake such a serious accusation?

30:58.880 --> 31:01.000
It's about life. Who would fake it?

31:01.840 --> 31:03.400
I never leave the house

31:03.480 --> 31:05.840
and follow the rules.
Everyone knows my reputation.

31:05.920 --> 31:07.080
My lord.

31:07.160 --> 31:08.880
He's not just a killer

31:08.960 --> 31:10.080
but also slanders me.

31:10.160 --> 31:11.600
If you don't punish him,

31:11.680 --> 31:12.880
it's clear favoritism.

31:12.960 --> 31:16.320
I'm a widow but won't stand it.

31:16.400 --> 31:19.120
If I can't get justice here,
I'll go higher.

31:19.800 --> 31:21.640
The Ministry of Justice will hear my case.

31:21.720 --> 31:23.800
If you refuse fairness,

31:23.880 --> 31:26.200
I'll die right here.

31:26.280 --> 31:27.440
I'll cause an uproar.

31:28.040 --> 31:29.520
If you protect the guilty

31:29.600 --> 31:32.040
and help your relatives,

31:32.120 --> 31:33.360
you'll face the law.

31:33.440 --> 31:35.320
Losing your title is the least.

31:35.840 --> 31:37.920
You could be exiled.

31:38.000 --> 31:39.320
Are you willing to risk that?

31:41.280 --> 31:43.840
Liu, one more false word

31:43.920 --> 31:45.680
and I'll charge you

31:46.600 --> 31:47.480
with court contempt.

31:48.480 --> 31:50.800
Chai An, did you hear that?

31:50.880 --> 31:53.680
She insists you're the killer.

31:53.760 --> 31:56.360
Her words are quite convincing.

31:56.440 --> 31:59.080
If you don't confess,
I'll have to use force.

32:00.040 --> 32:01.960
You only care about your title

32:02.920 --> 32:04.560
and your officialdom.

32:04.640 --> 32:07.200
But what about an innocent life?

32:07.280 --> 32:09.160
Shen Huizhao,

32:09.240 --> 32:10.480
how ironic.

32:10.560 --> 32:12.680
Letting a woman manipulate you like this?

32:13.320 --> 32:14.600
I didn't kill anyone.

32:15.200 --> 32:18.680
Beat me to death if you want.
I won't confess.

32:18.760 --> 32:24.800
Fine. Let's see how tough you really are.

32:24.880 --> 32:27.440
Guards, give him 30 strokes.

32:38.040 --> 32:39.240
Shen Huizhao,

32:40.280 --> 32:43.560
you're ruining lives with torture.

32:45.880 --> 32:48.200
Injustice! I'll die unjustly!

32:49.360 --> 32:51.120
Injustice!

32:52.760 --> 32:53.920
Shen Huizhao.

32:55.760 --> 32:58.320
My lord, he was already beaten

32:58.400 --> 32:59.760
- in the last trial.
- You wronged me.

32:59.840 --> 33:00.800
His wounds are severe.

33:00.880 --> 33:03.640
One more hit could kill him.

33:05.160 --> 33:07.200
Are you sure?

33:09.360 --> 33:10.360
Don't stop.

33:10.920 --> 33:13.000
Beat him until he confesses.

33:15.680 --> 33:16.680
Injustice!

33:16.760 --> 33:18.800
- Shen Huizhao has truly lost his way.
- You wronged me.

33:18.880 --> 33:20.880
Afraid of favoritism, he's gone too far.

33:21.800 --> 33:24.080
Haode, Chai An just took a beating.

33:24.160 --> 33:25.680
If this keeps up,

33:25.760 --> 33:27.120
even ten lives won't save him.

33:28.040 --> 33:29.040
Don't worry.

33:29.120 --> 33:31.160
- He knows his limits.
- You wronged me.

33:31.240 --> 33:32.240
Limits?

33:32.320 --> 33:35.880
He's cold and ruthless, famous for it.

33:35.960 --> 33:38.120
Haode, you married him.

33:38.200 --> 33:39.760
Does your heart follow him?

33:39.840 --> 33:40.920
Forget your family?

33:43.560 --> 33:45.600
Fine! I won't meddle anymore.

33:45.680 --> 33:47.240
Let's see how you tell Kangning.

33:48.360 --> 33:49.520
Haode.

33:57.160 --> 33:59.280
Even if I die

33:59.360 --> 34:00.480
and fall into hell,

34:00.560 --> 34:02.800
I won't let you go, Shen Huizhao!

34:03.880 --> 34:05.400
Shen Huizhao!

34:17.160 --> 34:19.160
My lord, he couldn't endure the torture.

34:19.240 --> 34:20.840
He bit his tongue and killed himself.

34:30.640 --> 34:32.160
- Really?
- Exactly.

34:33.040 --> 34:35.200
He was only questioned three times.

34:35.280 --> 34:36.840
The beating didn't reach 200 strokes.

34:37.800 --> 34:41.280
You all saw it. I wasn't being cruel.

34:41.360 --> 34:44.280
The suspect took his own life in fear.

34:44.360 --> 34:47.000
Exactly, 30 strokes can't kill a man.

34:47.680 --> 34:49.080
He died to escape his guilt.

34:49.160 --> 34:51.200
Though he didn't confess,

34:51.280 --> 34:53.560
evidence is clear.
There's no way to deny his crime.

34:54.760 --> 34:56.720
Since he died guilty,

34:56.800 --> 34:58.720
inform his family.
Let them claim his body.

34:59.760 --> 35:01.160
As for the details of the case,

35:01.240 --> 35:03.000
Liu's testimony will be recorded in full.

35:03.080 --> 35:04.880
Everything related to the case,

35:04.960 --> 35:06.880
I'll submit them to the court.

35:06.960 --> 35:09.720
Once approved, the case will close.

35:11.560 --> 35:12.840
Thank you for your fairness.

35:12.920 --> 35:14.480
You're a beacon of justice.

35:14.560 --> 35:16.200
My husband can rest in peace now.

35:25.640 --> 35:27.640
I heard Mr. Shen's an honest official.

35:27.720 --> 35:29.360
Indeed, he's a man of great principle.

35:29.960 --> 35:33.200
My testimony is enough
to close this case, right?

35:33.280 --> 35:36.800
Don't worry.
Once it's approved, it's over.

36:21.840 --> 36:23.080
Chai An.

36:23.880 --> 36:24.720
Chai An.

36:26.240 --> 36:27.400
Chai An.

36:29.880 --> 36:30.720
You…

36:34.240 --> 36:35.240
You!

36:36.080 --> 36:38.560
How could you leave me all alone?

36:39.360 --> 36:41.560
How am I supposed to go on now?

36:52.040 --> 36:54.040
You were such an upright man.

36:54.840 --> 36:56.640
How could fate deal you this blow?

36:56.720 --> 36:58.320
If your spirit lingers, bring justice.

36:58.400 --> 37:01.200
Punish those who made you a scapegoat.

37:11.920 --> 37:13.760
Take an innocent as a scapegoat.

37:13.840 --> 37:15.920
Another life taken by her hands.

37:16.680 --> 37:18.480
Heaven won't let her go so easily.

37:19.920 --> 37:22.000
Justice will find its mark in time.

37:22.080 --> 37:26.240
No one escapes the wheel of karma.

37:27.040 --> 37:30.600
Exactly. That's why karma is after him.

37:30.680 --> 37:31.960
If you dare speak ill again,

37:32.600 --> 37:34.560
heaven will punish you.

37:48.520 --> 37:50.440
KAIFENG COURT

38:39.560 --> 38:40.760
Hurry inside.

38:43.760 --> 38:45.200
Why are you so late?

38:46.800 --> 38:47.840
Did you miss me?

38:48.880 --> 38:51.400
- Lock the door once we're inside.
- Hurry.

38:52.920 --> 38:54.560
- Seize them.
- What are you doing?

38:54.640 --> 38:56.720
- Why are you arresting me?
- Take them.

38:57.280 --> 38:58.720
Do you even know who I am?

38:58.800 --> 38:59.960
I remember your face!

39:00.040 --> 39:01.320
Let me go!

39:17.960 --> 39:19.200
Kangning.

39:41.480 --> 39:44.240
Eat something. He's gone.

39:46.200 --> 39:50.240
Kangning, this is too big to keep secret.

39:50.320 --> 39:51.640
A funeral must happen.

39:52.560 --> 39:54.600
Let's return him to the Chai family.

39:54.680 --> 39:56.040
His mom will know eventually.

39:56.120 --> 39:58.040
My son-in-law,

39:59.080 --> 40:01.200
such a fine man he was.

40:01.280 --> 40:03.920
Gone just like that, out of nowhere.

40:04.000 --> 40:07.000
What grudge does the Shen family hold?

40:07.080 --> 40:09.400
Why help outsiders to harm us so?

40:10.360 --> 40:14.240
Now my daughter's a widow for no reason!

40:14.320 --> 40:15.400
Damn it all.

40:16.200 --> 40:18.000
Haode's a heartless girl.

40:18.080 --> 40:20.560
When Haode returns, I'll break her legs!

40:24.120 --> 40:26.120
Kangning, congratulations!

40:28.160 --> 40:29.320
Are you out of your mind?

40:30.240 --> 40:33.200
Her husband just died
and you congratulate her?

40:33.880 --> 40:37.080
His grave's not even settled
and you're already talking remarriage?

40:37.160 --> 40:38.560
What nonsense are you saying?

40:39.160 --> 40:40.600
Mom, what are you talking about?

40:41.400 --> 40:43.080
Enough.

40:43.160 --> 40:45.040
The court caught Liu's lover.

40:45.120 --> 40:47.960
They interrogated him overnight.
He's already confessed everything.

40:49.080 --> 40:50.200
Confessed?

40:52.040 --> 40:54.080
My good son-in-law.

40:54.160 --> 40:56.720
If you'd been a day later…

40:58.280 --> 40:59.400
They've caught him!

41:00.360 --> 41:01.480
Honey.

41:01.560 --> 41:04.120
Did you hear that? They got him!

41:05.760 --> 41:06.800
Honey, am I right?

41:06.880 --> 41:08.000
Justice prevails.

41:08.080 --> 41:11.040
I'm blessed, and the truth is out.

41:11.840 --> 41:13.680
How was my performance in court?

41:14.760 --> 41:17.520
Why did you pick up that relic?
It brought us so much trouble.

41:18.720 --> 41:20.800
Of course, I had to pick it up.

41:20.880 --> 41:23.400
It's what brought us together.
Can't lose it.

41:26.280 --> 41:27.920
You!

41:28.560 --> 41:29.640
And you guys!

41:33.520 --> 41:35.080
- Mom!
- Madam!

41:35.160 --> 41:36.320
- Wake up! Madam!
- Mother!

41:36.400 --> 41:37.240
Mom!

41:37.320 --> 41:38.520
- Mom.
- Are you alright?

41:39.760 --> 41:41.160
Both of them confessed?

41:41.920 --> 41:43.280
Liu refused to admit it.

41:43.360 --> 41:46.160
But Wangsheng couldn't endure the torture.

41:46.240 --> 41:48.000
By morning, he confessed everything.

41:48.600 --> 41:50.240
Turns out they were meeting in secret.

41:50.320 --> 41:51.920
Zhang Ping accidentally caught them.

41:52.000 --> 41:53.240
They fought,

41:53.320 --> 41:54.640
and Zhang Ping fell.

41:55.480 --> 41:57.480
So, my brother-in-law is innocent?

42:02.160 --> 42:03.840
How did you figure this out?

42:03.920 --> 42:06.120
I planned this during the first trial.

42:08.920 --> 42:10.880
You're a great officer.

42:10.960 --> 42:12.880
Forty strokes after one session.

42:12.960 --> 42:14.400
There had to be a reason.

42:15.320 --> 42:17.520
With no witnesses, Liu denied everything.

42:17.600 --> 42:18.800
If she never admitted it,

42:18.880 --> 42:20.880
this case would stay unsolved.

42:21.640 --> 42:23.760
So, you had to lure her out
and then do the trick.

42:23.840 --> 42:27.120
Well, am I clever or not?

42:28.520 --> 42:29.440
Sure.

42:32.240 --> 42:35.520
Actually, my sister's even smarter.

42:35.600 --> 42:38.200
She just refused to trust you at first.

42:38.280 --> 42:39.760
Good thing I convinced her.

42:41.440 --> 42:43.880
This case was way too easy.

42:43.960 --> 42:46.200
Honestly, I could've handled it myself.

42:56.320 --> 42:58.640
So, he loves sweets, huh?

43:02.520 --> 43:03.840
Brother,

43:04.640 --> 43:06.320
you might not remember much.

43:06.400 --> 43:09.600
But with me around,
you'll never blow your cover.

43:22.520 --> 43:25.480
What if he kept denying everything?

43:26.680 --> 43:29.400
This case was simple. You got lucky.

43:30.680 --> 43:32.480
If you faced something tougher…

43:32.560 --> 43:35.440
In my current state, it'd be hard.

43:41.040 --> 43:43.360
Hard or not, it has to be done.

43:43.440 --> 43:47.040
The Li family case dragged for years.

43:47.120 --> 43:49.240
They said family disputes were tricky.

43:49.320 --> 43:51.000
It stretched on year after year.

43:51.080 --> 43:52.840
My mom grew terrified of officials.

43:53.480 --> 43:55.320
If only we'd met

43:55.400 --> 43:56.760
someone like you earlier,

43:57.640 --> 44:00.720
we wouldn't have had to leave home.

44:02.480 --> 44:05.320
Brother. As an official, stay just.

44:05.400 --> 44:07.280
Losing your position isn't a big deal.

44:07.360 --> 44:09.360
But if some fools take over,

44:09.440 --> 44:11.600
how can common people live?

44:22.280 --> 44:23.440
Enough of this.

44:24.120 --> 44:26.880
The physician said
your injuries take time.

44:26.960 --> 44:28.240
You can't get better so soon.

44:29.200 --> 44:32.080
Leave this case to the magistrates.

44:32.160 --> 44:34.040
Take time to recover.
That's your priority now.

47:05.000 --> 47:07.560
Subtitle translation by: Yi Yang
